‎## 4. Handbook Protocol — Turn Challenges to Opportunities
‎
‎**When challenge appears, run KQ_INSTRUMENT:**
‎
‎**Closing laws from today applied:**
‎
‎- Choice gives direction (choose objective to preserve)
‎- Command gives movement (issue command that moves state)
‎- Time gives consequence (let time reveal pattern)
‎- Tide moves regardless (adapt or live in yesterday)
‎- Don't become attached to road. Become capable of navigating terrain. Road can disappear. Ability to navigate is what travels.
