‎
‎## 5. Final Declaration — Opportunity is Preserved Agency
‎
‎> Challenge is gate. Opportunity is ability to navigate gate without abandoning purpose.
‎
‎Tractor is not opportunity. Movement is.
‎
‎More powerful tool is not opportunity. Suitable, portable, consistent workflow is.
‎
‎Upgrade that opens gate today but creates dependency tomorrow is not opportunity. It's rented continuity.
‎
‎**True opportunity:**
‎
‎- Preserves invariant
‎- Increases portability (Rule #08)
‎- Reduces borrowed ground (Rule #07)
‎- Restores agency (Rule #13, #14)
‎- Travels with you when road disappears (Rule #15)
‎
‎**That is turning challenges to opportunities — operating capability, not positive thinking.**
